# Read by ripgrep (and so by Grep/Glob tooling) but not by git.
# These trees are tracked bulk data that dominate churn in the history (thousands
# of preset files, screenshots) and bury real source hits. Untracked run output
# is already hidden by .gitignore. Search them explicitly with `rg --no-ignore <pattern> <path>`.
public/milkdrop-presets/
screenshots/
tests/fixtures/milkdrop/parity-corpus/
tests/fixtures/milkdrop/projectm-upstream/
tests/fixtures/milkdrop/projectm-reference/
